    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d628">

                <pb facs="d627-3" n="3" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v03mSupp/d627-3"/>

                <head>628. Telegram 2068 to Geneva<anchor n="1" xml:id="d628-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1956-05-30">May 30, 1956, 3:50
                        p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <pb facs="d628-1" n="1" type="facsimile" xml:id="d628-1"/>
                <p>2068. For Johnson.</p>
                <p>Your 1949. Department believes transmittal text May 25 news conference
                    unnecessary. In light Deptels 2066 and 2067 you will understand why Department
                    prefers you endeavor avoid comment on Chinese prisoner matter.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#bold">Hoover</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
